#: io_directx_x-master/__init__.py:82
msgid "Connect the alpha channel of the diffuse (_D) texture to the material's Alpha input, and set the blend mode to alpha clip/blend. some games textures sometimes encode transparency in the diffuse alpha channel (e.g. leaf cutouts on plants, eye highlights). Without this, the textures look opaque in Blender's viewport even when they were authored with alpha.\n\nIf a texture has no alpha channel (most opaque materials), connecting alpha is a no-op so this is safe to leave on."
msgstr "将漫射（_D）纹理的 Alpha 通道连接到材质的 Alpha 输入，并将混合模式设为 Alpha 裁剪/混合。某些游戏的纹理有时会在漫射 Alpha 通道中编码透明信息（例如植物叶片镂空、眼睛高光）。若不启用，即使纹理制作时带有 Alpha，在 Blender 视图中也会显示为不透明。\n\n如果纹理没有 Alpha 通道（大多数不透明材质），连接 Alpha 不会产生任何效果，因此可以安全地保持开启。"

#: io_directx_x-master/__init__.py:512
msgid "Convert all polygons to triangles on export.\n\nON (default): produces triangle-only meshes, which load reliably in all DirectX viewers.\n\nOFF: preserves quads and n-gons. Turn this off to keep quad topology on round-trip"
msgstr "导出时将所有多边形转换为三角形。\n\n开启（默认）：生成仅含三角形的网格，可在所有 DirectX 查看器中可靠加载。\n\n关闭：保留四边面和 N 边形。关闭此项可在往返导入导出时保留四边面拓扑。"

#: io_directx_x-master/__init__.py:154
msgid "Convert quad and n-gon faces into pairs of triangles on import.\n\nON (default): all imported meshes have only triangle faces, matching what most engines use internally. Many .x files are exported with the original quad topology; without this option, those quads come through into Blender as-is.\n\nOFF: preserve the original quad / n-gon topology from .x files. Better for editing, subdivision, and animation workflows that benefit from quad mesh structure. Round-trip to .x preserves the quads"
msgstr "导入时将四边面和 N 边形面转换为成对的三角形。\n\n开启（默认）：所有导入的网格仅含三角形面，与大多数引擎内部使用的结构一致。许多 .x 文件以原始四边面拓扑导出；若不启用此选项，这些四边面会原样进入 Blender。\n\n关闭：保留 .x 文件原有的四边面 / N 边形拓扑。更适合编辑、细分以及受益于四边面网格结构的动画工作流。往返导出到 .x 时会保留四边面。"

