#: io_directx_x-master/__init__.py:470
msgid "Declare the standard DirectX templates at the top of the file. Strict template-driven loaders (FPS Creator / Dark Basic's converter, ModelConverterX, Virtual Sailor NG) reject files whose data objects use undeclared templates, so this should stay enabled unless the target engine is known to pre-register everything itself. When the model was imported from a .x file, that file's own template block is re-used and topped up with any missing standard templates"
msgstr "在文件顶部声明标准 DirectX 模板。严格的模板驱动加载器（FPS Creator / Dark Basic 的转换器、ModelConverterX、Virtual Sailor NG）会拒绝数据对象使用未声明模板的文件，因此除非确定目标引擎会自行预注册所有模板，否则应保持启用。若模型是从 .x 文件导入的，则复用该文件自身的模板块，并补齐缺失的标准模板。"

