#: io_directx_x-master/__init__.py:107
msgid "Fold a mirrored (negative-determinant) frame into the mesh geometry instead of leaving it in the matrices. Blender rebuilds bone rests as pure rotations, so a reflected frame always ends up with an axis flipped between Rest and Pose. Turn off to restore the old behaviour"
msgstr "将镜像（负行列式）Frame 折叠进网格几何体，而不是保留在矩阵中。Blender 会将骨骼静止姿态重建为纯旋转，因此反射的 Frame 在静止姿态和姿态之间总会有一个轴发生翻转。关闭可恢复旧行为。"

#: io_directx_x-master/__init__.py:459
msgid "For meshes without a UV map, write a MeshTextureCoords block of zeroed coordinates instead of omitting it. Some strict consumers (Virtual Sailor-style) treat the missing block as malformed"
msgstr "对于没有 UV 贴图的网格，写入一个坐标全为零的 MeshTextureCoords 块，而不是省略它。某些严格的读取器（Virtual Sailor 风格）会把缺失该块视为格式错误。"

