msgid "Put everything from this file into a new collection named after the file.\n\nON (default): imported objects are grouped together, keeping the outliner tidy when importing several files.\n\nOFF: objects are added straight to the scene's collection, with no extra grouping"
msgstr "将此文件中的所有内容放入以该文件命名的新集合。\n\n开启（默认）：导入的物体归入同一组，在导入多个文件时保持大纲视图整洁。\n\n关闭：物体直接添加到场景集合中，不额外分组。"

