#: io_directx_x-master/__init__.py:97
msgid "Use the FrameTransformMatrix hierarchy (which in most .x files is the first animation frame) as the rest pose, matching the old behaviour. Off (default): use the model's own bind pose from the SkinWeights matrixOffset, so the rest pose is the authored rig"
msgstr "将 FrameTransformMatrix 层级（在大多数 .x 文件中即第一个动画帧）用作静止姿态，与旧行为一致。关闭（默认）：使用模型中来自 SkinWeights matrixOffset 的绑定姿态，使静止姿态即为制作的骨架。"

#: io_directx_x-master/__init__.py:171
msgid "Use the dedicated import path for DirectX 8.0-style files: a single skinned mesh with SkinWeights / matrixOffset bind matrices and rigid (one-bone-per-vertex) binding. Leave off for general .x files from common exporters (the original, well-tested path)"
msgstr "对 DirectX 8.0 风格的文件使用专用导入路径：单个蒙皮网格，带有 SkinWeights / matrixOffset 绑定矩阵以及刚性（每顶点一根骨骼）绑定。对于常见导出器生成的普通 .x 文件请保持关闭（即原有且经过充分测试的路径）。"

#: io_directx_x-master/__init__.py:187
msgid "Weld Duplicate Vertices"
msgstr "焊接重复顶点"

#: io_directx_x-master/__init__.py:421
msgid "When ticked, exports the material values as originally imported from the .x file, ignoring any changes made in Blender. When unticked (default), exports the current Blender material state so your edits are included in the output"
msgstr "勾选时，按从 .x 文件最初导入的材质值导出，忽略在 Blender 中所做的任何更改。取消勾选（默认）时，导出当前 Blender 材质状态，以便你的编辑包含在输出中"

#: io_directx_x-master/__init__.py:446
msgid "Write Material blocks anonymously inside each mesh's MeshMaterialList instead of declaring them once at the root and referencing them by name. Native Virtual Sailor files use the inline style, and some strict template-driven parsers resolve it more reliably than cross-object references"
msgstr "将材质块匿名写入每个网格的 MeshMaterialList 中，而不是在根级别声明一次并按名称引用。原生 Virtual Sailor 文件使用内联样式，某些严格的模板驱动解析器比跨对象引用更能可靠地解析它"

#: io_directx_x-master/__init__.py:470
msgid "Write Template Declarations"
msgstr "写入模板声明"

#: io_directx_x-master/__init__.py:459
msgid "Write Zero UVs When Missing"
msgstr "缺失时写入零 UV"

#: io_directx_x-master/__init__.py:486
msgid "Write the animation block with high-precision tick conventions used by some biped/game exports:\n  • AnimTicksPerSecond = 4800 (vs the FPS field's value)\n  • AnimationKey nodes named 'R', 'S', 'T' (rotation/scale/translation)\nBlender frame numbers are scaled to the 4800-tick rate so the animation plays at the correct real-time speed."
msgstr "使用某些双足/游戏导出所采用的高精度 tick 约定写入动画块：\n  • AnimTicksPerSecond = 4800（而非 FPS 字段的值）\n  • AnimationKey 节点命名为 'R'、'S'、'T'（旋转/缩放/平移）\nBlender 帧号会缩放到 4800 tick 速率，以便动画以正确的实时速度播放。"

